foundation.solution_text:
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.4]
\draw[gray!30,very thin,xstep=1,ystep=2] (0,0) grid (8,16);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,17.2);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0);
\foreach \y in {2,4,6,8,10,12,14,16} {\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.3,\y) {$\y$};}
\node[below left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,0) {$0$};
\foreach \x in {2,4,6,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$};}
\draw[dashed,red] (0,0)--(8,0)--(8,16);
\node[font=\scriptsize,below] at (4,0) {$8\text{ s}$};
\node[font=\scriptsize,right] at (8,8) {$16\text{ m/s}$};
\draw[very thick,blue] (0,0)--(8,16);
\foreach \pt in {(0,0),(8,16)} {\fill[blue] \pt circle (2.5pt);}
\node[rotate=90,font=\scriptsize] at (-1.6,8) {Speed (m/s)};
\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (4,-1.2) {Time (s)};
\node[font=\scriptsize] at (4,17.8) {A car accelerating from rest};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Acceleration $=\dfrac{16-0}{8-0}$
$=2$ m/s²

